V2 -- LEMMA A (support-6 floor): K(n)=0 unless >=6 nonzero non-7 coords
==============================================================================
  (a) C(U) = sum_{T superset U, T subset {1..6}} (-1)^|T|  (independent calc):
      C(U)=0 for all |U|<6, C(full)=1 :  OK
  (b) EXHAUSTIVE support 1..5, coords in {-8..8}\{0,+-7} (structured, not random):
      support 1: tested     14 tuples, running max|K|=2.94e-16
      support 2: tested    196 tuples, running max|K|=2.94e-16
      support 3: tested    512 tuples, running max|K|=2.94e-16
      support 4: tested   4096 tuples, running max|K|=2.94e-16
      support 5: tested  32768 tuples, running max|K|=2.94e-16
      OVERALL max|K| over support<=5 = 2.94e-16 at n=(-1,)
  (c) support-6 examples (must be NONZERO -> floor sharp):
      n=[1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 6]: |K|=2.370160e-06
      n=[1, 1, 1, 1, 1, 1]: |K|=4.996588e-03
      n=[1, -1, 2, -2, 3, -3]: |K|=4.740319e-05
      n=[3, 3, 3, 3, 3, 3]: |K|=8.821466e-04
  (d) support-2 kernel W[j,l] identically zero: True  (=> shortest relations contribute K=0)

